-- RAG evaluation corpus + golden set seed (rag-minimal-slice T01, issue #136).
--
-- This file bootstraps the LOCAL evaluation database only. PostgreSQL is the
-- single source of truth for the golden set: after this seed runs, edits
-- happen in the database and the committed CI fixture
-- (backend/testdata/rag_golden_cases.json) is regenerated by the env-gated
-- full-eval test (OMNICRAFT_RAG_FULL_EVAL=1 + OMNICRAFT_RAG_WRITE_ARTIFACTS=1),
-- never by hand.
--
-- Corpus: content_items id 1001-1039 are the deterministic evaluation corpus
-- (migrated agent-eval contents 1001-1013, zh cold 1014-1025, en 1026-1030,
-- forbidden 1031-1035, en 1036-1038, zh hot 1039). Golden cases also
-- reference the demo corpus (ids 26-100) shipped with the local seed dataset;
-- those rows carry real embeddings from a previous embedding run.
--
-- Reserved ID ranges (do not reuse outside this fixture):
--   users:           9201-9299
--   content_items:   1001-1039
--   content_versions: one version (version_number 1) per content above
--
-- ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE keeps seed re-runs idempotent so the database always
-- matches this fixture definition.

